The host names and addresses of well-known public DNS resolvers, collected by the Datapavan project
from each operator's own pages and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in ADR 0015, ADR 0029 and DESIGN.md 13.2.
